  every new pair is kept by a test added or edited since the record: yes
  every changed pair of the record is kept by a test edited since it, or of a file whose fixtures or helpers changed (change NSG): yes
  control: the same comparison finds a pair of a test not added or edited: yes
  control: the same comparison finds a changed pair of a test neither edited nor of a changed file: yes

